#. 間違いないわ…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "When it comes to that protein can..."
msgstr ""

#. あのプロテインの容器は…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...there's not a doubt in my mind."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>密室が破られるまで<CLT>は…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Until <CLT 9>the locked room was unlocked<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 娯楽室にはなかったのよ！
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...it absolutely was not in there!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、あの容器は…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So you're saying..."
msgstr ""

#. 密室が破られた後に
#. 持ち込まれたんか？
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"...someone planted it there\n"
"after we got the door open?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そんなはずはない…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "No...no, that's impossible..."
msgstr ""

#. あれは…
#. ずっと娯楽室にあったはずだ…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I-It had to have been\n"
"in there the whole time!"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん…
#. <CLT 9>密室が破られる前から<CLT>な…！
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It had to be! It was in there before\n"
"<CLT 9>the rec room was unlocked<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>何を言っている…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>What are you talking about...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>どういう事…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>What does that mean?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ふーん…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hmph...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>プロテインの容器が…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>The protein can...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>現場になかった、だと…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>It wasn't at the crime scene?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そ、そうだよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Th-That's right...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>十神の言う通りだよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>It's just like Byakuya said!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>いいえ、違うわ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>No, that can't be...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>アタシは白夜様を信じるわ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>I have faith in Master!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
